    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHAIN CORP</strong> is a 20-card deckbuilder / card-battler with a late-stage capitalism theme. <br><br> Note* <i>JOIN THE PLAYTEST, YOUR FEEDBACK CAN HAVE A BIG IMPACT ON THE PROJECT AT THIS STAGE OF DEVELOPMENT</i><br><strong> </strong><br><strong>MAIN MECHANICS:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 card decks, tons of complexity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards are played onto FIELD SLOTS that can be destroyed or created during play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUDGET is how you pay for cards and SALARY is how much budget you gain each turn.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHARACTER cards stand and fight on the field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CORPORATE cards are instant with effects like manipulating resources, direct damage, or drawing cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are eight DAMAGE TYPES, each enemy has unique weaknesses/resistances.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The CORRUPTION meter consistently rises and must be carefully balanced.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LIQUIDATE cards at will from your hand for instant resources and corruption management.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHAIN CORP</strong> is a 20-card deckbuilder / card-battler with a late-stage capitalism theme. <br><br> Note* <i>JOIN THE PLAYTEST, YOUR FEEDBACK CAN HAVE A BIG IMPACT ON THE PROJECT AT THIS STAGE OF DEVELOPMENT</i><br><strong> </strong><br><strong>MAIN MECHANICS:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 card decks, tons of complexity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards are played onto FIELD SLOTS that can be destroyed or created during play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUDGET is how you pay for cards and SALARY is how much budget you gain each turn.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHARACTER cards stand and fight on the field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CORPORATE cards are instant with effects like manipulating resources, direct damage, or drawing cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are eight DAMAGE TYPES, each enemy has unique weaknesses/resistances.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The CORRUPTION meter consistently rises and must be carefully balanced.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LIQUIDATE cards at will from your hand for instant resources and corruption management.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Single-player card-battler with a late-stage-capitalism theme and rogue-lite progression. 20-card decks, each run is unique, insane game-breaking combos.",
